  "fullDescription": "Charcoal Grain Glow Mini Procreate Brush Set – 8 brush variations in total: Includes 3 monoline versions of the glitter brush with 3 different levels of outer glow, and one with no outer glow. 3 more versions of the brush but with high width pressure sensitivity when used with the apple pencil where the width and glow decreases when you press lightly and gets wider when you press harder with the apple pencil.\n\n*REQUIRES PROCREATE APP & IPAD / IPAD PRO\n\n*INSTANT DIGITAL DOWNLOAD. THIS IS A DIGITAL FILE. NO PRINTED OR PHYSICAL PRODUCT OR ITEM WILL BE SENT OR MAILED*\n\nA digital sparkle shimmer glimmer shiny glow realistic gel pen charcoal pencil grainy texture brush .brushset pack tool for iPad or iPad Pro drawing, sketching, painting, calligraphy hand lettering, for many aesthetics: nebula, galaxy, space, abstract stars, fairy dust, magic, witch & a Halloween witchy magical aesthetic, glamour, confetti, cute doodles, kawaii, manga, anime, retro vintage, goth, gothic, boho, artsy, school, office, work, studying, university, college, uni, teacher, student, back to school stationary, planner, planning, minimalist, punk rock, sweet, casual, cool, classy, elegant, etc. You can use these brushes for backgrounds, Facebook, Youtube, Instagram social media images, graphic design, illustration, drawing, character art, portrait art, valentines day art, birthday cards, party invitations, scrapbooking, scrapbooks, digital planning, randomly doodling, etc.\n\nA tool for digital artists, graphic design, iPad Pro hand lettering, calligraphy, writing, planning, drawing, art, illustrating / illustration, painting and more.\n\nHappy drawing! 🙂\n\nWHAT’S INCLUDED: 2 .brushset files –\n\n– 1 .brushset file:\nBrushes 1-3: 3 monoline versions of the glitter brush with equal width and no width pressure sensitivity, with 3 different levels of outer glow\nBrush 4: One monoline brush, like the previous ones, but with no outer glow\nBrushes 5-7 – 3 more versions of the brush but with high width pressure sensitivity when used with the apple pencil where the width and glow decreases when you press lightly and gets wider when you press harder with the Apple Pencil.\nBrush 8: One pressure sensitive glitter brush, like the previous ones, but with no outer glow\n\n– 1 .brushset file ‘SMOOTH LINE’ version of the same brush set that has the same brushes but the settings are edited to provide more line control with less jitter which can be useful for hand lettering.\n\nMORE INFORMATION ON THE BRUSHES:\n\n(All brushes have opacity pressure sensitivity when used with the Apple Pencil)\n\nHappy drawing 🙂\n\nZara Roza Designs",
